raph: 等级： 公立三甲\n- paragraph: 地址：广州市越秀区盘福路1号\n- paragraph: 电话：020-81048888\n- paragraph\n- paragraph: 预约开始时间：00:00\n- paragraph: 预约截止时间：23:59\n- paragraph\n- paragraph: 简介：\n- paragraph: 广州市第一人民医院是广州市卫生局下属大型综合性医院，是广州地区医疗、教学、科研、预防保健和康复的重要基地。始建于1899年（光绪25年），至今已有112年历史。1993年被卫生部评定为广东省首批三级甲等医院；1995年通过国家级爱婴医院评估，取得“爱婴医院”称号； 1996年被市编办定为市副局级单位；1997年通过广东省高等医学院教学医院的评估，被广州市政府确定为广州医学院附属市一人民医院；2001年底被定为广州市城镇职工基本医疗保险第一批定点医疗机构；2003年批准挂牌为广州市临床重症救治中心。现为广州铁路集团和海南省、深圳市、东莞市、中山市、江门市、佛山顺德区、佛山南海区、从化市、花都区、南沙区等地"}, "axe_violations": [{"id": "html-has-lang", "impact": "serious", "help": "<html> element must have a lang attribute", "helpUrl": "https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.14/html-has-lang?application=playwright", "tags": ["wcag2a", "wcag311"], "nodes_count": 1, "samples": [{"selector": "html", "html": "<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">"}]}, {"id": "image-alt", "impact": "critical", "help": "Images must have alternative text", "helpUrl": "https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.14/image-alt?application=playwright", "tags": ["wcag2a", "wcag111"], "nodes_count": 1, "samples": [{"selector": "img[src$=\"beian.png\"]", "html": "<img style=\"vertical-align: middle\" src=\"./images/common/beian.png\">"}]}, {"id": "landmark-one-main", "impact": "moderate", "help": "Document should have one main landmark", "helpUrl": "https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.14/landmark-one-main?application=playwright", "tags": ["best-practice"], "nodes_count": 1, "samples": [{"selector": "html", "html": "<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">"}]}, {"id": "link-name", "impact": "serious", "help": "Links must have discernible text", "helpUrl": "https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.14/link-name?application=playwright", "tags": ["wcag2a", "wcag244", "wcag412"], "nodes_count": 1, "samples": [{"selector": ".pb_pre_off", "html": "<a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"pb_pre_off\" disabled=\"true\">&nbsp;</a>"}]}, {"id": "page-has-heading-one", "impact": "moderate", "help": "Page should contain